 "description": "<p>Chenlun (沉沦) is identified as the developer and owner of the Outsider Phishing Kit, a sophisticated Adversary-in-the-Middle (AiTM) smishing as a service toolkit. He was first observed promoting the kit through Telegram channels in October 2022. Additionally, Chenlun &nbsp;has been linked to advertisements for the toolkit on underground forums such as CVV-Goods and Cosmileonnly in the past.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
